Google Input Tools – Modern Windows
Independent community modernization project.

This project studies the architecture and public source history of
https://github.com/google/google-input-tools. The upstream project is licensed under
Apache License 2.0 and is archived by its owner. This repository is maintained separately;
it is not an official Google product and does not imply Google endorsement.

The initial modernization scaffold contains newly written build configuration, documentation,
and prototype code. No upstream source files or language data are copied in this initial commit.
Any future imported upstream material must retain required copyright, license, and attribution
notices, and its provenance must be documented here.
